<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Paiement Échoué - E-Learning Platform</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600&display=swap');

        :root {
            --primary: #4A90E2;
            --danger: #E74C3C;
            --bg: #fff8f8;
            --text: #2c3e50;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff8f8 0%, #ffeaea 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.1), 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            animation: slideUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) both;
        }

        @keyframes slideUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(40px) scale(0.95);
            }

            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
            }
        }

        .icon-ring {
            width: 88px;
            height: 88px;
            background: rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 28px;
            animation: popIn 0.5s 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) both;
        }

        @keyframes popIn {
            from {
                transform: scale(0);
            }

            to {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
        }

        .icon-ring svg {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            stroke: var(--danger);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c0392b 0%, #E74C3C 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 300;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .order-info {
            background: #fff5f5;
            border: 1px solid rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.15);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            margin: 20px 0 28px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #555;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .order-info span {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .order-info strong {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c0392b 0%, #E74C3C 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.3);
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(231, 76, 60, 0.42);
        }

        .btn:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .hint {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #aaa;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-ring">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line>
                <line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <h1>Paiement Échoué</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Votre paiement n'a pas pu être complété. Il a été annulé ou refusé.</p>

        {{#if transactionId}}
        <div class="order-info">
            <span><strong>Référence :</strong> {{transactionId}}</span>
            {{#if reason}}<span><strong>Raison :</strong> {{reason}}</span>{{/if}}
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <a href="{{frontendUrl}}" class="btn">Retour à l'accueil</a>
        <p class="hint">Vous pouvez réessayer votre paiement depuis votre tableau de bord.</p>
    </div>
</body>

</html>